{"id":"3771cb3ddfd32097","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-relation-extension.md","title":"Relation Extension","display":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-relation-extension","aliases":["89-df-relation-extension","relation extension","关系扩张"],"display":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-relation-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-relation-extension</span><span>relation extension</span><span>关系扩张</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation-extension — Relation Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\">\\(F&#39;=(W,R&#39;)\\)</span>，两个框架载体相同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F^\\prime)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F^\\prime)\\)</span> 是下述定义的同载体关系扩张谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq R&#39;\\subseteq W^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq R&#39;\\subseteq W^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此定义仅表示加边。若赋值相同且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不含模态算子，则扩大 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 更难、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A\">\\(\\Diamond A\\)</span> 更易成立；对含嵌套盒的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，它在后继世界的真值也会改变，不能直接套用这种单调性。加自环可破坏 GL 的非自反性；传递闭包需取全部有限路径，不是只加一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^2\">\\(R^2\\)</span>。\n来源：第 4 章 pp.68–77 的关系语义；“关系扩张”为本目录整理用术语。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F'=(W,R')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F^\\prime)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelExt}(F,F')\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq R'\\subseteq W^2.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R^2","display":false}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"68d8a94406ea9586","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ec5d35474706206","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-relation-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["c78d4bf1505bda5c"]}